Viewer: no black bars and no reconnect when the page opens (2026-10-12).

The picture always fills the page, stretched per axis (touch is normalized per axis). A close shape
(within 20%: the car page 1280x756 vs fullscreen 1280x846) is renegotiated only on entering
fullscreen; a clearly different shape (portrait, split screen) is renegotiated at once, as before.

